msgid "cexp2, cexp2f, cexp2l - base-2 exponent of a complex number"
msgstr "cexp2, cexp2f, cexp2l - Exponent einer komplexen Zahl zur Basis 2"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
